.TH ckman-fido-info 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-fido\-info \- Display general status of the FIDO application
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-fido\-info\fR [\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Display general status of the FIDO application
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<PIN>\fR
CanoKey Admin PIN to read the actual SM2 ID (uses PC/SC)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
